notes.content:
Added a new NPC - Pills Merchant. With their help, you can strengthen your character. The assortment of stores has also been expanded, some bugs have been fixed.

List of changes:
*Added a new NPC - Pills Merchant. He spawns randomly some days. Found in hallways;
*Added many new items of food, pills and more;
*Assortment of all stores has been expanded;
*Strength now grants 15 damage points instead of 5;
*Endurance now grants 5 stamina recovery per second, up from 2;
*Now "Explore" consumes less needs;
*Experience system has been changed. Less experience is now required to level up;
*Added help in the main menu and in the beginning of the game;
*Fixed a bug with incorrect display of progress for some girls;

I also thank all the players for their support!

This update fixes the incorrect operation of the "Explore" location properties that did not work on some versions of Windows. Some more bugs were also fixed.

List of changes:
* Fixed the ability to explore locations;
* Fixed displacement of the interface when playing with a high resolution;
* Fixed interaction with girls. The correct dialog now appears;
* Fixed the balance of actions "Crime". Now they bring in more money and more justify the risk;
* Added new items that can be found when exploring locations;
